  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Basst&#xf6;d European Malaria Vaccine Initiative.EMVI etabl 1998 av Europ Comm o intr EUmedl stater f&#xf6;r att ta hand om identif. brister i strukturer i offentl finansierad malaria vacc utv. EMVIs syfte &#xe4;r att skapa en mekanism gnm vilk utv av experimentell malaria vacc kan accelerera inom Europ o i utv l&#xe4;nder, spec gnm sponsring av  GoodManufPractice tillverkn of vacc o klin f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;k.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Supp EuropeanMalariaVaccineInitiative.EMVI established 1998 by EuropComm, &amp; interested EUMemberStates to address identified struc- tural deficiencies in publicly funded malaria vacc dev TheEMVI aim is to provide a mechanism thru which the dev of experimtal malaria vacc. can be accelerated within Europe &amp; in dev countries, particularly by sponsoring the GoodManufPract manufacture of lead vacc &amp; clin.trials.</narrative>
